<noinclude>
{{Documentation|doc=
This provides one or more toggle boxes to display the latest modding news on the wiki. This is most notably used in {{ll|Template:Navbar modding}} to easily show users the latest updates and changes related to modding with an easy access from any modding pages to not miss them.

== Usage ==
{{tlx|ModdingNews}}
{{ModdingNews}}

== See also ==
{{ll|Template:ToggleBox}}
}}
</noinclude><includeonly>{{ToggleBox|title=<div style="text-align: center;">[[Build 42.21.0]] Modding News (September 24th, 2026)</div>|id=modding-news|class=blue|content=
''The following modding changes are provided unofficially by parsing the latest [[game files]] for interesting changes that may affect modding or be useful to modders.''

* <code>loadstring</code> and <code>loadstream</code> functions were added back.
* New [[registries|registry system]] for keybinds <code>KeybindId</code>. Every actions now have a specific identifier.
** You can notably use it to check when a specific action keybind is pressed.
** Global method variants <code>isKeyDown</code>, <code>wasKeyDown</code> and <code>isKeyPressed</code> using those instead of a string.
** New methods in <code>Core</code> class to add keybinds <code>addKeyBinding</code> (variant to the one taking a string, can now take a <code>KeybindId</code> instead).
* New method <code>createCorpseZombie</code> in [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/VirtualZombieManager.html VirtualZombieManager].
* New exposed classes:
** <code>KeybindId</code>
** <code>GridSquareEdgeFacingDirection</code>
** <code>GridSquareEdge</code>
** <code>TradingState</code>
* New methods related to usernames length limits: <code>getMinUsernameLength</code> and <code>getMaxUsernameLength</code>.
* Two new [[Lua event]]s:
** <code>LogLevelPerk</code>
** <code>OnTileObjectAdded</code>
* Lots of logic relatic to IsoGridSquare and neighbours have been updated.
** <code>isWallTo</code>, <code>isWindowTo</code>
** <code>getEast</code>, <code>getWest</code>, <code>getNorth</code>, <code>getSouth</code>
** <code>isEastOf</code>, <code>isWestOf</code>, <code>isNorthOf</code>, <code>isSouthOf</code>
** <code>isDiagonalTo</code>
** <code>getOppositeSquare</code> (using new <code>GridSquareEdge</code> class)
** And a lot more. A lot of these were already present in some shape or form but there's likely a lot of new stuff like these to explore.
* <code>getRectsBounds</code> for <code>IsoRoom</code> instances.
* New [[Console#Configuring logging|DebugType]]s: <code>ClientCommand</code>, <code>VehicleClientCommand</code>, <code>UnitTest</code>.
* New tile property (IsoPropertyType) <code>CarSlowFactor</code>.
* New <code>nearWallCrouching</code> [[animation]] variable.
* New methods in <code>IsoGameCharacter</code>: 
** <code>transmitHaloNote</code>
** <code>isSitting</code> (ground, <code>isSitOnGround</code>, and furniture, <code>isSittingOnFurniture</code>)
** <code>setNearWallCrouching</code>, <code>isNearWallCrouching</code>
* New method in <code>IsoAnimal</code>: <code>delete</code> (supposedly removes the animal from the game).
* Having timed action instant cheat on now allows for instant item equip in hands.
}}<includeonly/>
